request.description:
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Who can call it: super_admin, admin, program_administrator.
Optional: fullName, phone, role, isActive. The example body holds the required fields only.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/organizations/{{organizationId}}
Who can call it: super_admin, admin.
Optional: name, code, description, contactEmail, contactPhone, contactHours, address, timezone, timeFormat, isActive. The example body holds the required fields only.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/farms/me/farms/{{farmId}}
Who can call it: Any signed in user.
Optional: name, areaAcres, location, businessEntity, latitude, longitude. The example body holds the required fields only.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/farms/{{farmId}}
Who can call it: super_admin, admin, program_administrator.
Optional: name, areaAcres, location, businessEntity, latitude, longitude, ownerId, isActive. The example body holds the required fields only.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/fields/{{fieldId}}
Who can call it: super_admin, admin, program_administrator.
Optional: name, areaAcres, crop, season, irrigation, location, latitude, longitude, sowingDate, expectedHarvest, isActive, boundary. The example body holds the required fields only.

PUT {{baseUrl}}/assessments/my/programs/{{programId}}/fields/{{fieldId}}/categories/{{categoryId}}/records/{{recordId}}
Who can call it: Any signed in user.
Required: answers. Optional: evidenceUrls. The example body holds the required fields only.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/assessments/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Who can call it: super_admin, admin, program_administrator.
Optional: scores, categoryScores, overallScore, note. The example body holds the required fields only.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/assessments/templates/{{templateId}}
Who can call it: super_admin, admin, program_administrator.
Optional: name, description, isActive. The example body holds the required fields only.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/assessments/categories/{{categoryId}}
Who can call it: super_admin, admin, program_administrator.
Optional: name, description, sortOrder, isActive. The example body holds the required fields only.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/assessments/questions/{{questionId}}
Who can call it: super_admin, admin, program_administrator.
Optional: categoryId, questionCode, questionText, questionType, maxScore, options, evidenceMode, commentMode, guidanceNote, score0Description, score1Description, score2Description, score3Description, sortOrder, isActive. The example body holds the required fields only.

PUT {{baseUrl}}/assessor/programs/{{programId}}/fields/{{fieldId}}/categories/{{categoryId}}/records/{{recordId}}
Who can call it: assessor.
Required: answers. Optional: evidenceUrls. The example body holds the required fields only.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/programs/{{programId}}
Who can call it: super_admin, admin, program_administrator.
Optional: name, code, description, type, startDate, endDate, userLimit, isActive, showToFarmers, questionKind, assessmentTemplateName, assessmentTemplateId. The example body holds the required fields only.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/programs/{{programId}}/enrollments/{{enrollmentId}}
Who can call it: super_admin, admin, program_administrator.
Required: fieldIds. The example body holds the required fields only.

POST {{baseUrl}}/field-monitoring/fields/{{fieldId}}/modules/{{module}}
Who can call it: farmer, super_admin, admin, program_administrator.
The body depends on the module in the path. Send the fields of that module.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/field-monitoring/fields/{{fieldId}}/modules/{{module}}/{{id}}
Who can call it: farmer, super_admin, admin, program_administrator.
The body depends on the module in the path. Send the fields of that module.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/faqs/{{faqId}}
Who can call it: super_admin, admin.
Optional: question, answer, sortOrder, isActive. The example body holds the required fields only.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/program-admin-surveys/templates/{{templateId}}
Who can call it: super_admin, admin, program_administrator.
Optional: name, description, isActive. The example body holds the required fields only.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/program-admin-surveys/templates/{{templateId}}/scoring-rules/{{ruleId}}
Who can call it: super_admin, admin, program_administrator.
Optional: minScore, maxScore, isActive. The example body holds the required fields only.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/program-admin-surveys/categories/{{categoryId}}
Who can call it: super_admin, admin, program_administrator.
Optional: name, description, icon, sortOrder, isActive. The example body holds the required fields only.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/program-admin-surveys/questions/{{questionId}}
Who can call it: super_admin, admin, program_administrator.
Optional: categoryId, questionText, helpText, weight, sortOrder, isActive, options. The example body holds the required fields only.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/program-admin-surveys/programs/{{programId}}
Who can call it: super_admin, admin, program_administrator.
Optional: name, description, templateId, contractTemplateId, isActive. The example body holds the required fields only.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/program-admin-surveys/contracts/{{contractId}}
Who can call it: super_admin, admin, program_administrator.
Optional: name, intro, clauses, isActive. The example body holds the required fields only.
